<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Universal macro for Death Ball or any "ball" type roblox game, great auto-clicker and auto-F for 1v1s or PvPs in-game, run the macro and you can play. Note: It hasn't been tested on every ball type game, only on a few some. (Also be sure to carefuly use it, since I don't really know if this is banneable)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 9 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 3 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 3 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 3 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 3 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 3 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 3 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 3 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 3 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>